              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno apaka Kristo won bende k'omiyere dwoŋ ma bedo jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam. Kucel, Were ama owaco rigo ni,",
          "type": "text",
