                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kwo pere i piny ka, Yesu odhiro kwayo kodi ywakirok pere gi pigi waŋe munyo koko malo ri Were, ma d'onyalo botho go kwoŋ tho. Aka Were owinjo go, rupiri go oyido ŋata mwol ma winjo Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kada go oyido obedo Wod Were, go ofonjere winjo Bamere i candirok pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo otiek lonyo go kicutho, go olokere jakeli kwo makirum ri ji je ma jomako wac pere; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka Were oketho go bedo jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam i cal pa Melikizedek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
