          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitie wac kweth ma wanyalo waco kwoŋ gime, to tek tito riwin, rupiri wibolbol i niaŋ gim'ifonjo win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 3:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabedo ma di wibedi jofonji, odoko fodi yenyere moro wofonji win ayino adieri pa Were m'icako gine! Kama di wicam'iye cemo pa jom'otegino, fodi wiyenyo cak amadha ayino! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋata madho cak, meno fodi nyathi ma kuya poko gim'otire kodi gima k'otire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To cemo manwaŋ, obedo apa jom'otegino ma jotieko ŋeyo poko gima beyo gi reco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
